OL,5,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FTina and her daughter Kay welcome
OL,7,     Ftheir rivals to the Foxhall
OL,8,     FVillage Guest House in Blackpool.
OL,9,     FBut the shared facilities don't
OL,10,     Fwash with their guests.
OL,11,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FRaqeeb and Raj hope to pip their
OL,13,     Frivals to the post with their
OL,14,     Fslick operation and competitive
OL,15,     Fpricing at the Douglas Hotel in
OL,16,     FHartlepool. But will a dinner
OL,17,     Fding-dong scupper their chances?
